WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.729
This codon needs a partner.

00:00:02.124 --> 00:00:03.807
Three tRNAs try out.

00:00:04.144 --> 00:00:06.303
The first one's anticodon doesn't match.

00:00:06.594 --> 00:00:07.162
It leaves.

00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:09.113
The second doesn't match either.

00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:10.077
Gone.

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:12.840
The third has the complementary anticodon.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:14.988
It pairs and stays.

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.937
Each tRNA has its own anticodon.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.725
Like a lock that only opens for

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:20.317
one key.

00:00:20.537 --> 00:00:21.884
Now try the question again.
